[25.180533, "o", "Population by SA2 Region - 2022-23\r\nSource: Australian Bureau of Statistics, Regional Population 2022-23\r\nSA2_CODE SA2_NAME STATE POPULATION_2023\r\n101021007 Braidwood New South Wales 4396\r\n101021008 Karabar New South Wales 8483\r\n101021009 Queanbeyan New South Wales 11420\r\n101021010 Queanbeyan - East New South Wales 5099\r\n101021012 Queanbeyan West - Jerrabomberra New South Wales 12873\r\n101021610 Googong New South Wales 7352\r\n101021611 Queanbeyan Surrounds New South Wales 17274\r\n101031013 Bombala New South Wales 2468\r\n101031014 Cooma New South Wales 6781\r\n101031015 Cooma Surrounds New South Wales 3538\r\n101031016 Jindabyne - Berridale New South Wales 8381\r\n101041017 Batemans Bay New South Wales 8662\r\n101041018 Batemans Bay - South New South Wales 9030\r\n101041019 Bega - Tathra New South Wales 8926\r\n101041020 Bega-Eden Hinterland New South Wales 9711\r\n101041021 Broulee - Tomakin New South Wales 3852\r\n101041022 Deua - Wadbilliga New South Wales 41\r\n101041023 Eden New South Wales 3424\r\n101041024 Eurobodalla Hinterland New South Wales 3611\r\n101041025 Merimbula - Tura Beach New South Wales 11597\r\n101041026 Moruya - Tuross Head New South Wales 8643\r\n101041027 Narooma - Bermagui New South Wales 9946\r\n101051539 Goulburn New South Wales 25017\r\n101051540 Goulburn Surrounds New South Wales 14121\r\n101061541 Yass New South Wales 6807\r\n101061542 Yass Surrounds New South Wales 12967\r\n101061543 Young New South Wales 10956\r\n101061544 Young Surrounds New South Wales 7719\r\n102011028 Avoca Beach - Copacabana New South Wales 7494\r\n\r\n\r\n...\r\n"]
